# The bmds icon theme (devplan/rom.md §3f, §3i): the icons BMDS's own applications use, made
# from the two icon sets in thirdparty/ by tools/mkrom.py into /rom/share/icons/bmds.icons.
#
#   NAME                        THEME       SOURCE          [mirror]
#
# NAME: freedesktop.org's Icon Naming Specification's name (BMDS's own, for what it doesn't
#       name). THEME: flat-color, glyphs, or bmds (BMDS's own: rom/icons/svg, rendered into
#       rom/icons/png by tools/render-icons rom/icons). SOURCE: the icon's file in that set,
#       without .png, at 16x16 and 32x32. mirror: flipped left to right.
#
# A line's place is its IconId's number (bmds/iconid.h, generated): add lines at the END only,
# never remove, rename or reorder one once shipped. Flat-color where it has the icon (the
# desktop's look), glyphs for the rest.

# --- Places
folder                          flat-color  folder
folder-open                     flat-color  opened_folder
user-home                       flat-color  home
user-desktop                    glyphs      monitor
user-trash                      flat-color  empty_trash
user-trash-full                 flat-color  full_trash
user-bookmarks                  flat-color  bookmark
folder-music                    flat-color  music
folder-pictures                 flat-color  picture
folder-documents                flat-color  document
folder-download                 flat-color  download
start-here                      flat-color  services

# --- Devices
computer                        glyphs      monitor
drive-harddisk                  glyphs      hard-drive
drive-removable-media           glyphs      sd-card
media-flash                     glyphs      sd-card-1
media-optical                   flat-color  cd_logo
audio-card                      flat-color  speaker
audio-input-microphone          glyphs      microphone
audio-headphones                flat-color  headset
input-keyboard                  glyphs      keyboard
input-mouse                     glyphs      mouse
input-gaming                    glyphs      gamepad
video-display                   glyphs      monitor
printer                         flat-color  print
camera-photo                    flat-color  camera
camera-web                      flat-color  webcam
phone                           flat-color  phone
network-wired                   glyphs      plug
network-wireless                glyphs      wifi
battery                         flat-color  full_battery
drive-usb                       flat-color  usb

